---
import { url } from '../utils/url-utils';
---
<section class="card-base p-6 md:p-8 mb-4">
<p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--primary)] mb-3">陈逸妤的学习手记</p>
<h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-90 mb-3">记录学习和成长的过程</h1>
<p class="text-60 leading-relaxed">光学是本行，深度学习还在摸索，喜欢vibe coding开发work工作流，正在学习西语</p>
<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-6">
<a href={url('/optics/')} class="block rounded-xl p-5 transition bg-[var(--btn-regular-bg)] hover:bg-[var(--btn-regular-bg-hover)]">
<span class="text-xs tracking-widest text-[var(--primary)]">OPTICS</span>
<h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-90 mt-2 mb-2">光学 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2>
<p class="text-sm text-60 leading-relaxed">从光的传播，到成像与计算。</p></a>
<a href={url('/deep-learning/')} class="block rounded-xl p-5 transition bg-[var(--btn-regular-bg)] hover:bg-[var(--btn-regular-bg-hover)]">
<span class="text-xs tracking-widest text-[var(--primary)]">DEEP LEARNING</span>
<h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-90 mt-2 mb-2">深度学习 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2>
<p class="text-sm text-60 leading-relaxed">机器学习基础、Transformer 与计算机视觉的学习笔记。</p></a>
</div></section>
